complaint_what_happened:
Support request : # XXXX with Venmo On XX/XX/XXXX, Venmo suspended my account with a balance of nearly {$4000.00}. I reached out to them and requested that my account be closed and funds returned to me through their online contact form. They responded back through email on XX/XX/XXXX requesting my drivers license which I uploaded. Within an hour or two, they closed my account and said that they closed my business account but my personal account was still active. There was no mention of the funds remaining in my business account.

I responded to their email asking about the funds on XX/XX/XXXX but never received a response. I reached out through their chat support and spoke to online support ( request XXXX  ). They said they would forward my info on and someone would get back to me. I received no response. On XX/XX/XXXX, I attempted to contact them and received a message it was out of hours and they would get back with me. I also received no response.

Essentially, they promptly closed my account with no explanation of what will happen with my funds and refuse to acknowledge any requests. I would like to receive the funds from my business account totaling nearly {$4000.00}
